1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,630
Heavy floods this week forced thousands
of families to leave their homes.

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:07,380
Rescue teams are still reaching some
villages, and officials have confirmed

3
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:09,290
that several people lost their lives.

4
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:13,120
Schools and community halls have been
opened as shelters, where volunteers are

5
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:15,000
serving hot food and clean water.

6
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:18,430
Doctors are visiting the camps to
check on children and older people.

7
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:22,500
If you would like to help, local charities
are collecting blankets and dry food.

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,700
Our thoughts are with every
family who has lost someone.
